# Markdown is hand-authored editorial content and documentation; Prettier's
# markdown printer can subtly reflow prose/list-continuation indentation in
# ways that change rendered structure, so it's excluded repo-wide. Markdown
# structure is instead linted with markdownlint-cli2 (.markdownlint-cli2.jsonc)
# and prose double-spacing is normalized with
# scripts/normalize-prose-spacing.mjs -- both are AST-aware and safe for
# Markdown/MDX (see `bun run lint`/`bun run format`).
*.md
# Leading slash anchors this to the repo-root `content/` directory only --
# without it, this would also match `app/pages/content/` and
# `app/components/content/`, which are Vue code, not editorial content.
/content/
